 {{ article.title }}
</div>
<span class="new-centered-article-text">
NYC’s summers are humid and for the most part do not require a lot of outerwear. The Camp Hero Vest and Caliper Jacket help to bridge transition seasons in and out of summer as well as dealing with typical Northeast summer elements through the summer months.
</span>

